# Strings


## Problems (easy to hard)

Work top to bottom. Each level adds one new idea on top of the last.

### Level 1 - Basics
Idea: strings are immutable in Python; convert to list for in-place edits.

LeetCode 344.     Reverse String                                  -- two pointers
LeetCode 345.     Reverse Vowels of a String  - DONE
LeetCode 14.      Longest Common Prefix  - DONE
LeetCode 125.     Valid Palindrome                                -- two pointers, skip non-alphanumeric
LeetCode 242.     Valid Anagram                                   -- frequency count
LeetCode 387.     First Unique Character in a String
LeetCode 205.     Isomorphic Strings                              -- two-way mapping

### Level 2 - Frequency maps and parsing
LeetCode 49.      Group Anagrams                                  -- sorted word or count tuple as key
LeetCode 151.     Reverse Words in a String
LeetCode 8.       String to Integer (atoi)                        -- careful edge cases
LeetCode 28.      Find the Index of the First Occurrence in a String-- then learn KMP
LeetCode 3.       Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters  -- sliding window
LeetCode 438.     Find All Anagrams in a String                   -- fixed sliding window

### Level 3 - Palindromes (expand around centre)
LeetCode 5.       Longest Palindromic Substring                   -- expand around each centre
LeetCode 647.     Palindromic Substrings
LeetCode 516.     Longest Palindromic Subsequence                 -- DP, compare with 5

### Level 4 - Hard
LeetCode 76.      Minimum Window Substring                        -- sliding window with need/have counts
LeetCode 72.      Edit Distance                                   -- DP on two strings
LeetCode 10.      Regular Expression Matching                     -- DP
